On the short side, we like STZ back toward $125. We are adding puts into this modest rally.
 
DELL is up 10% after better-than-expected results from SMCI.
 
There is resistance near $460.20.
 
If the market remains firm, bears may concede a move to that level.
 
We want to use the rally to close our position.
 
