TLDR: ➤ Buy MS September 18th $200 puts at $5.10 or less, day order only. If filled, immediately place a sell order at $7.90.

 

Stocks are mixed as oversold semiconductors bounce modestly, while financials are struggling to hold last week's breakouts despite excellent earnings.
 
Increased volatility is common during the summer months.
 
Tech stocks continue to correct their first-half 2026 gains as traders rotate into laggards.
 
That is constructive, but bulls need to reclaim the S&P 500 20-day moving average at 7,495 on a closing basis early this week.
 
