We also continue to like the breakout developing in TER. The chart is clean. The trend is strong. We see a path toward $465. We have attached the chart for review, but we are passing on the trade for now.
 
The market feels like a tug-of-war between rising rates and improving growth expectations. Eventually one side wins. Until then, discipline matters more than conviction.
 
