➤ Buy TSLA July 17th $530 Calls at $4.40. Day Order Only
➤ Buy ETN July 17th $480 Calls at $5.50. Day Order Only
➤ Sell remaining half of META June 18th $700 Calls at $5.00. Good-'Til-Canceled (GTC).
Money goes where it is most welcome and stays where it is best treated. Right now, software, AI infrastructure, and select industrials continue to attract capital. We want to stay aligned with that trend while remaining disciplined with risk.

 

