All good news. Except GOOGL, the stocks are down.
 
Earnings reports are always a coin flip at best. Stocks rise on bad news and falter on sensational reports.
 
Unsurprisingly, NVDA is also getting whacked. The theory among traders is that news cannot possibly get any better.
 
It can.
 
