Happy Wednesday,
 
TLDR: ➤ Sell HOOD & APLD

 

The S&P 500 is rising this morning in response to President Trump's decision to extend the current ceasefire with Iran.
 
We are watching Bitcoin press toward major resistance at $77,954. If bulls can push through, bears are in a heap of trouble. Bitcoin is important because it is a proxy for the risk-on trade.
 
ARM is a noteworthy breakout. Readers of other Markman letters know this is a favorite idea. If shares hold above $184 today, it will be a big deal. First target is $199, then $225.
 
