APLD opened stronger again but is trending back to unchanged.
 
There is no real resistance until $40, but we do not like the sloppy intraday action. We are selling some.
 
WMT got the stronger close on Tuesday, but shares are flat today. No real resistance until the old high at $135. We will stay with this.
 
RTX is getting whacked for a second session. Defense stocks are falling across the board as traders bet the war with Iran is over. These stocks normally trade on the basis of defense budgets, not wars. Bulls like us need a big reversal starting today.
 
