Happy Thursday,
 
TLDR: Buy USO puts

 

The one-day-up, one-day-down chop continues as traders fixate on headlines out of the Middle East. President Trump said this morning that Iran “better get serious,” suggesting little progress toward ending the conflict. That’s enough to keep traders on edge.
