That rotation is underway.
Financials are at new highs, and speculative stocks are once again finding bids.
Our favorite in that space is IONQ, though we are also watching CRSP and RXRX closely.
CRSP has an upside target of $67.50.
RXRX could trade to $7, but bulls need a close above $5.20 to confirm momentum.
